---

<Layout>
  <!-- HERO SECTION (Asymmetrical 12-Column Bento Grid with Profile & PFD HUD) -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 mb-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Profile & Identity Bento (Col 4, Row 2) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 hardware-card">
        <div class="hardware-card-inner flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
          <div class="specular-line"></div>
          
          <!-- Portrait & Status -->
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-2xl bg-[#07080b]">
              <img
                src="/profile.webp"
                alt="Muhammet Hüseyin Arbağ"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top filter grayscale contrast-105 hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050506] via-transparent to-transparent opacity-80"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#00e676]">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#00e676] animate-pulse"></span>
                  STAJ &amp; ÇALIŞMAYA AÇIK
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-400 bg-black/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-white/5">
                  ERU H.E.E.
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Muhammet Hüseyin Arbağ</h2>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#00e5ff] font-mono mt-0.5">Avionics &amp; Systems Engineer</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Erciyes Üniversitesi Havacılık Elektrik &amp; Elektroniği (3. Sınıf). Uçak aviyonik şebekeleri ve Linux sistemleri araştırmacısı.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Quick Action Buttons -->
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-white/[0.06] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
            <a href="#ozgecmis" class="text-neutral-300 hover:text-white flex items-center gap-1 font-medium">
              <span>Özgeçmiş (CV)</span>
              <span class="text-[#00e5ff]">↓</span>
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:muhammet@arbag.dev" class="text-neutral-400 hover:text-[#00e5ff] transition-colors">
              muhammet@arbag.dev
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Primary Statement Bento (Col 8, Row 2) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 hardware-card">
        <div class="hardware-card-inner flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="specular-line"></div>
          
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <!-- Eyebrow Tag -->
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04]">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#00e5ff]"></span>
              <span class="mono-telemetry text-[10px] text-neutral-300 font-medium">
                ATA SPEC 2200 // AVIONICS &amp; LOW-LEVEL SYSTEMS
              </span>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Heading -->
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.12]">
              Fiziksel dünyanın determinizmi ile sistem yazılımının sınırları.
            </h1>

            <!-- Narrative Paragraph -->
            <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              Havacılık elektrik-elektroniği disipliniyle yetişmiş; uçak güç dağıtımı (ATA 24), radyo seyrüsefer (ATA 34 / ILS), 
              Linux çekirdeği ve deterministik yapay zeka ajan mimarileri üzerine çalışan sistem araştırmacısı. 
              Kodun yalnızca çalıştığı anla değil; bus transfer gecikmelerinde, frekans dalgalanmalarında ve bellek kısıtlarında nasıl davrandığıyla ilgilenirim.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- CTAs & Action Ribbon -->
          <div class="pt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
            <a
              href="#ozgecmis"
              class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 pl-5 pr-2 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/[0.08] hover:bg-white/[0.14] hover:border-white/30 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
            >
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white tracking-tight">Özgeçmiş &amp; Yetkinlikleri İncele</span>
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-xs group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform text-[#00e5ff]">
                ↓
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="#aviyonik-araclar"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-[#00e5ff] hover:text-white border border-[#00e5ff]/30 bg-[#00e5ff]/5 hover:bg-[#00e5ff]/10 transition-colors font-mono"
            >
              <span>Aviyonik Araçları</span>
              <span class="text-xs">⚡</span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="#laboratuvarlar"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-white border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors"
            >
              <span>The 9-System Matrix</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-600 font-mono">/ 10</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Secondary Bento 1: Live Primary Flight Display (PFD) HUD (Col 6) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 hardware-card">
        <div class="hardware-card-inner flex flex-col justify-between" id="hud-card">
          <div class="specular-line"></div>
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.05] pb-2 text-[10px] mono-telemetry text-neutral-500">
            <span>PFD INSTRUMENT // CANLI KOKPİT GÖSTERGESİ (60 FPS CANVAS)</span>
            <span class="text-[#00e676]">GYRO AKTİF</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Interactive Primary Flight Display Component -->
          <div class="my-3">
            <FlightDisplayHUD />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] mono-telemetry text-neutral-400 pt-1">
            <span>FARE İLE PİTCH &amp; ROLL DÖNGÜSÜNÜ TEST ET</span>
            <span class="text-[#00e5ff]">CANVAS RENDERER</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Secondary Bento 2: Core Engineering Specs (Col 6) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 hardware-card">
        <div class="hardware-card-inner space-y-4">
          <div class="specular-line"></div>
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] mono-telemetry text-neutral-500 border-b border-white/[0.05] pb-2">
            <span>SYSTEM CONSTRAINTS &amp; STANDARDS</span>
            <span>SPEC: ARBAG-01</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-neutral-400">Uçak Güç Standardı:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold">115V AC 400Hz (3-Faz) / 28V DC</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-neutral-400">Bara İzolasyon Hızı:</span>
              <span class="text-[#00e676] font-semibold">&lt; 15 ms (Bus Tie Contactor)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-neutral-400">Aviyonik Veri Yolu:</span>
              <span class="text-[#00e5ff] font-semibold">ARINC 429 &amp; MIL-STD-1553B</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-neutral-400">Mühendislik Kuralı:</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-300">DO-178C Level B &amp; Fail-Safe Redundancy</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-neutral-400">Uçak Simülatörleri:</span>
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">10 Canlı ATA Laboratuvarı</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 01 // ÖZGEÇMİŞ & MÜHENDİSLİK KÜNYESİ (CV SECTION) -->
  <section id="ozgecmis" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 mb-32 scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-10 border-b border-white/[0.06] pb-6">
      <div>
        <div class="mono-telemetry text-[11px] text-[#00e5ff] font-semibold mb-2">01 // ÖZGEÇMİŞ &amp; MÜHENDİSLİK KÜNYESİ</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Curriculum Vitae</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/cv.txt"
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-300 hover:text-white transition-all"
        >
          <span>Metin CV Görüntüle</span>
          <span class="text-[#00e5ff]">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:muhammet@arbag.dev"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#00e5ff]/30 bg-[#00e5ff]/10 text-xs font-mono text-[#00e5ff] hover:bg-[#00e5ff]/20 transition-all font-semibold"
        >
          <span>İletişime Geç</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CV Bento Matrix -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Eğitim & Akademik -->
      <div class="hardware-card">
        <div class="hardware-card-inner space-y-4">
          <div class="specular-line"></div>
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.06] pb-3 text-xs font-mono">
            <span class="text-[#00e5ff] font-bold">[ 01. EĞİTİM &amp; STANDARTLAR ]</span>
            <span class="text-neutral-500">2022 - 2026</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Erciyes Üniversitesi</h4>
              <p class="text-neutral-400 font-mono text-[11px]">Havacılık ve Uzay Bilimleri Fakültesi</p>
              <p class="text-[#00e676] font-mono text-[11px] mt-0.5">Havacılık Elektrik ve Elektroniği (3. Sınıf)</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/[0.05] text-neutral-400">
              <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-neutral-300 font-semibold">• SHY-147 / EASA B2 Aviyonik Müfredatı</p>
              <ul class="space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-[11px] text-neutral-400">
                <li>• <strong class="text-neutral-200">AEE 301:</strong> Radyo Seyrüsefer &amp; ILS/VOR/DME/Marker Beacon</li>
                <li>• <strong class="text-neutral-200">AEE 303:</strong> Otomatik Uçuş Kontrol &amp; Otopilot PID Algoritmaları</li>
                <li>• <strong class="text-neutral-200">ATA 24:</strong> Uçak Elektrik Güç Dağıtımı &amp; Yük Atma (Load Shed)</li>
                <li>• <strong class="text-neutral-200">HEE 305:</strong> Uçak Yakıt, Hidrolik ve Pnömatik Sistemleri</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Kariyer & Staj Hedefleri -->
      <div class="hardware-card">
        <div class="hardware-card-inner space-y-4">
          <div class="specular-line"></div>
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.06] pb-3 text-xs font-mono">
            <span class="text-[#00e676] font-bold">[ 02. HEDEF &amp; ÇALIŞMA ALANLARI ]</span>
            <span class="text-neutral-500">STAJ / AR-GE</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Savunma &amp; Havacılık Sanayii</h4>
              <p class="text-neutral-400 text-[11px] mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                TUSAŞ, Baykar, Aselsan, Turkish Technic, TEI ve Roketsan gibi sektör liderlerinde değer üretmek üzere odaklanılan alanlar:
              </p>
            </div>

            <ul class="space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/[0.05] text-[11px] text-neutral-400">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#00e676] font-bold">▹</span>
                <span><strong class="text-neutral-200">Aviyonik Sistem Tasarımı:</strong> ARINC 429 / 1553B haberleşmesi, uçuş bilgisayarları ve seyrüsefer.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#00e676] font-bold">▹</span>
                <span><strong class="text-neutral-200">Gömülü Sistemler &amp; Doğrulama:</strong> Gerçek zamanlı sistemler (RTOS/Linux), HIL/SIL simülasyon testleri.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#00e676] font-bold">▹</span>
                <span><strong class="text-neutral-200">Uçak Bakım Elektroniği (B2):</strong> Hat ve üs bakımında arıza teşhisi, bara testleri ve emniyet analizleri.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Donanım & Laboratuvar Yetkinlikleri -->
      <div class="hardware-card">
        <div class="hardware-card-inner space-y-4">
          <div class="specular-line"></div>
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.06] pb-3 text-xs font-mono">
            <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">[ 03. SAHA &amp; LABORATUVAR ]</span>
            <span class="text-neutral-500">DONANIM / CAD</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Laboratuvar Ekipmanları</h4>
              <p class="text-neutral-400 text-[11px] mt-1">
                Fiziksel donanım hata ayıklama ve test tecrübesi:
              </p>
